{"id": "sf-general-dialysis-medicare-payment-reductions", "title": "Medicare assigned San Francisco General’s dialysis center a 1.5% payment reduction", "seconds": 43.2, "voice": "elevenlabs:OtHu0lbpdNTqJVqaxDtR", "narrator": "Maven", "made": "2026-11-27", "key": "6a08c847abcdc071", "words": 133, "beats": [{"scene": "a", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Medicare cut the dialysis payment rate at San Francisco General.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 3.15, "shot": "s0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["Dialysis", "payments"], "sub": "San Francisco General"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.47, 0.65, 0.75, 1.26, 1.59, 1.82, 1.93, 2.12, 2.57]}, {"scene": "a", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "In 2024 and 2025, the reduction was half a percent.", "t0": 3.27, "t1": 6.49, "shot": "s1", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "0.5%", "label": "2024 and 2025 payment years"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.32, 0.83, 0.93, 1.16, 1.92, 2.07, 2.49, 2.62, 2.79, 2.85]}, {"scene": "a", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "For 2026, it rose to 1.5 percent.", "t0": 6.61, "t1": 8.98, "shot": "s2", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "1.5%", "label": "2026 payment reduction"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.36, 0.93, 1.03, 1.24, 1.37, 1.52, 1.75, 1.99]}, {"scene": "a", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The center received reductions in eight payment years.", "t0": 9.1, "t1": 11.51, "shot": "s3", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "8", "label": "Years with reductions"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.47, 0.81, 1.31, 1.45, 1.65, 1.96]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The center scored 29 points.", "t0": 11.73, "t1": 13.32, "shot": "s4", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "29", "label": "Facility performance score"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.37, 0.65, 1.09]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The California average was 55. The national average was 54.", "t0": 13.44, "t1": 17.58, "shot": "s5", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "55", "label": "California average"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.73, 1.07, 1.21, 2.26, 2.45, 2.87, 3.28, 3.45]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "CMS gave the center zero points for dialysis adequacy.", "t0": 17.7, "t1": 20.41, "shot": "s6", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "scores", "text": "Kt/V Comprehensive Score", "mark": "Score"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.42, 0.59, 0.68, 0.95, 1.25, 1.56, 1.69, 2.15]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The 2026 payment year uses performance measured in 2024.", "t0": 20.53, "t1": 24.32, "shot": "s-year", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["2024", "Performance year"], "b": ["2026", "Payment year"], "kicker": "Medicare dialysis quality program"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.27, 0.62, 1.07, 1.4, 1.69, 1.98, 2.55, 2.88, 2.98, 3.23]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Hospitalization and readmission also received zero points.", "t0": 24.44, "t1": 27.42, "shot": "s-outcomes", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "tps", "kicker": "Measures", "text": "Hospitalization and readmission", "mark": "readmission"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.82, 0.94, 1.54, 1.88, 2.19, 2.49]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]"], "text": "The payment score alone cannot establish harm to patients.", "t0": 27.54, "t1": 30.06, "shot": "s-scope", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Patient outcomes require separate evidence"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.4, 0.66, 0.97, 1.28, 1.67, 1.85, 1.94]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "It earned ten points for medication reconciliation.", "t0": 30.18, "t1": 32.73, "shot": "s7", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "scores", "text": "Medication Reconciliation Measure Score", "mark": "Reconciliation"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.43, 0.72, 1.04, 1.17, 1.66]}, {"scene": "c", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "A second Medicare file confirms the payment reduction.", "t0": 32.95, "t1": 35.14, "shot": "s8", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "tps", "text": "Alternate CCN", "mark": "Alternate"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.39, 0.75, 1.0, 1.35, 1.44, 1.71]}, {"scene": "c", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The claims pricing code for 2026 was three.", "t0": 35.26, "t1": 37.65, "shot": "s9", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "3", "label": "Claims pricing code"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.09, 0.41, 0.77, 1.04, 1.18, 1.41, 1.87, 2.01]}, {"scene": "c", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The center’s actual reduction in dollars remains unknown.", "t0": 37.77, "t1": 40.07, "shot": "s10", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "tps", "text": "Payment Reduction Percentage", "mark": "Percentage"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.41, 0.7, 1.08, 1.17, 1.51, 1.85]}, {"scene": "c", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 40.19, "t1": 42.34, "shot": "end", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.31, 0.65, 0.8, 1.06, 1.17, 1.26, 1.5, 1.76]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"a": "The payment cut", "b": "The score", "c": "The payment file"}, "look": "newsroom", "hook": "document"}